  =E2=80=A2 :recycling_symbol: `opam init --reinit' (command typically call=
ed
    after upgrading from an older opam version) got improved. It now
    stops asking to retry the command when upgrading from a 2.1 opam
    root, and regenerates switches metadata to allow tools that use the
    opam library to load the switch informations without modifying the
    opam root ([#7057], [#7066])

  =E2=80=A2 :houses: When `--safe' is given, opam used to reset debug-level=
 to
    0. This is no longer the case. Consider updating your scripts
    accordingly. ([#7000])

